- to use assistant you need actual HuggingFace api key for downloading LLM model DeepSeek
- Copy code start from "Сборка ассистента" to "Проверка без интерфейса"
- run installations first
- run main code
- create new assistant as NotebookAssistant class with hf_token as parameter
- after finishing download model assistant can process notebooks from your account
- if you need, you can save and/or load DF or Database (recommend to save locally, save to dirve yet not implemented)
